    "identifier": "yamada-test-cutting-helmet-drop",
    "description": "<p>You assume a readied stance before swinging downward, fast and hard enough to kick up a small shockwave and even crack the ground. Make a melee taijutsu attack against a creature in range. On a hit you deal your [Weapon Damage] + 2d12.</p>\n<p>Ideal Cut: The affected creature must make a Constitution saving throw, having their AC reduced by 2, until the beginning of your next turn.</p>\n<p>Tao: The affected creature must make a Constitution saving throw, having their next saving throw they make suffer a -2 penalty before the beginning of your next turn.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost by 3 and the damage by 1d12.</p>",
